    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but thats the thing. there is no \"reclaiming\" it. the person i was is literally dead. it's not like i'm just having a bad phase, it's like the core of me just evaporated. everything feels so performative and fake now. like im just a shell performing the ritual of being a person for no reason at all. does that even make sense? or am i just spiraling?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
